@layout()
<div style="margin-bottom: var(--space-4);">
  <a href="/help">&larr; Back to Help</a>
</div>

<article class="card">
  <header>
    <h3>Search</h3>
  </header>

  <p>
    SpeakerWindows provides a powerful hybrid search that combines text search with vector-based semantic search.
  </p>

  <h4>How to Search</h4>
  <ol>
    <li>Navigate to the <strong>Search</strong> page from the sidebar or top navigation.</li>
    <li>Type your query into the search box.</li>
    <li>Press <strong>Search</strong> or hit Enter to see results.</li>
  </ol>

  <h4>Search Tips</h4>
  <ul>
    <li>Use natural language queries for semantic search (e.g., "quotes about courage").</li>
    <li>Use specific keywords for text-based matching (e.g., author names, titles).</li>
    <li>Combine both approaches for the best results.</li>
  </ul>

  <h4>Filtering Results</h4>
  <p>
    You can click on tags or authors in the search results to narrow down to a specific subset of illustrations.
  </p>
</article>
@end
